   "date": "2025-02-10",
   "house": "senate",
   "question": "The majority voted against a [motion](https://www.openaustralia.org.au/senate/?id=2025-02-10.8.2) introduced by Tasmanian Senator [Jonathon Duniam](https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/people/senate/tasmania/jonathon_duniam) (Liberal), which means it failed. ### Motion text > *That so much of standing orders be suspended as would prevent me from moving a motion to provide for the consideration of a matter, namely a motion to give precedence to a motion relating to the consideration of the [Defence Service Homes Amendment (Insurance) Bill 2025](https://www.aph.gov.au/Parliamentary_Business/Bills_Legislation/Bills_Search_Results/Result?bId=r7304).*",
